# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS
# Most source files carry an `SPDX-License-Identifier:` line, and that line is
# authoritative for the file it stands in. This file assigns a licence to the
# rest by path -- the brand artwork, the ELF test corpus, the vendored
# bootloader -- so that every single file in the repository has an answer.
# The reasoning is in LICENSING.md; the full text is in LICENSE.

