Files: vendor/limine/*
Copyright: 2019-2025 Mintsuki and contributors
Comment: The Limine bootloader. Four of these files go onto the ISO --
 limine-bios.sys, limine-bios-cd.bin, limine-uefi-cd.bin and BOOTX64.EFI,
 3437860 octets in total -- and execute on every boot before the kernel.
 2-clause BSD is GPL-2.0-compatible, so there is no conflict. TWO OPEN ITEMS:
 (1) build.sh lines 239-242 copy the binaries onto the ISO and do NOT copy
 vendor/limine/LICENSE, which clause 2 of that licence asks for; (2) the
 version is not pinned anywhere -- no tag, no commit, no checksum -- which
 makes it the only foreign dependency in this project family without a pin.
 Both are recorded in THIRD_PARTY.md.
License: BSD-2-Clause

